# Fixture corpus lives under tests/fixtures/ at the repo root.
# Default: ignore everything; whitelist the small set of formats we keep.
# The trailing `!*/` allows git to recurse into subdirectories so the
# `!*.json` re-include picks up JSON files at any depth (e.g. tests/
# fixtures/determinism/pr.json).
*
!*/
!*.gitignore
!*.gitkeep
!*.json
!*.patch
!determinism/test_determinism.py
!prs/smoke/*/src/*.py
*.tar.gz
